帝與襃有舊，相得甚歡。拜侍中，累遷吏部尚書、左僕射。襃既世冑名家，文學優贍，當時咸相推挹，故旬月之間，位升端右。寵遇日隆，而襃愈自謙虛，不以位地矜人，時論稱之。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","voice_scope":"史臣敘事","mentions":[{"id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538:p003:m0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"梁元帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cav_2xc_9bq_AAB","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"liangyuan","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳及書信換聲/政權時間的來源角色辨識；不由全域單字、近名或同廟號自動選人。","identity_decision_id":"d-zhou041-liangyuan"},{"id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538:p003:m0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"襃","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"bao","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳及書信換聲/政權時間的來源角色辨識；不由全域單字、近名或同廟號自動選人。","identity_decision_id":"d-zhou041-bao"},{"id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538:p003:m0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"襃","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"bao","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳及書信換聲/政權時間的來源角色辨識；不由全域單字、近名或同廟號自動選人。","identity_decision_id":"d-zhou041-bao"},{"id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538:p003:m0040","start":40,"end":43,"surface":"王僧辯","kind":"person","person_id":"ndk_fcd_lgu","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"wangsengbian","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳及書信換聲/政權時間的來源角色辨識；不由全域單字、近名或同廟號自動選人。","identity_decision_id":"d-zhou041-wangsengbian"},{"id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538:p003:m0048","start":48,"end":49,"surface":"襃","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"bao","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳及書信換聲/政權時間的來源角色辨識；不由全域單字、近名或同廟號自動選人。","identity_decision_id":"d-zhou041-bao"},{"id":"c-zhoushu-041-wangbao-ws2432538:p003:m0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"元帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cav_2xc_9bq_AAB","status":"contextual_provisional","source_role":"liangyuan","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳及書信換聲/政權時間的來源角色辨識；不由全域單字、近名或同廟號自動選人。","identity_decision_id":"d-zhou041-lia